messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 67 and 11?', "<think>\nTo find the product of 67 and 11, I can use the standard multiplication method.\n\nFirst, I'll write down the numbers:\n\n```\n  67\n× 11\n```\n\nNext, I'll multiply 67 by the units digit of 11, which is 1:\n\n```\n  67\n×  1\n------\n  67\n```\n\nThen, I'll multiply 67 by the tens digit of 11, which is also 1, and shift the result one position to the left:\n\n```\n  67\n× 10\n------\n670\n```\n\nFinally, I'll add the two results together:\n\n```\n  67\n+670\n------\n737\n```\n\nSo, the product of 67 and 11 is 737.\n</think>.\n\nTo find the product of **67** and **11**, follow these easy steps:.\n\n1. **Multiply 67 by 1 (units place of 11):**.\n   .\n   \\[.\n   67 \\times 1 = 67.\n   \\].\n\n2. **Multiply 67 by 10 (tens place of 11):**.\n   .\n   \\[.\n   67 \\times 10 = 670.\n   \\].\n\n3. **Add the two results together:**.\n   .\n   \\[.\n   67 + 670 = 737.\n   \\].\n\nSo, the product of **67** and **11** is:.\n\n\\[.Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
