messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 13 and 70?', "<think>\nFirst, I need to calculate the product of 13 and 70. To make the multiplication easier, I can break down 70 into 7 multiplied by 10.\n\nNext, I'll multiply 13 by 7. \n\n13 multiplied by 7 equals 91.\n\nFinally, I'll multiply 91 by 10 to get the final result.\n\n91 multiplied by 10 equals 910.\n\nTherefore, the product of 13 and 70 is 910.\n</think>.\n\n**Solution:**.\n\nTo find the product of 13 and 70, follow these steps:.\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:**.\n   .\n   \\[.\n   13 \\times 70 = 13 \\times (7 \\times 10).\n   \\].\n\n2. **Multiply 13 by 7:**.\n   .\n   \\[.\n   13 \\times 7 = 91.\n   \\].\n\n3. **Multiply the result by 10:**.\n   .\n   \\[.\n   91 \\times 10 = 910.\n   \\].\n\n**Final Answer:**.\n\n\\[.Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
